      "name": "CacheGameFunctionPointer",
      "signature": "void CacheGameFunctionPointer(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves and caches the D2 game function pointer to a global variable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls GetD2FunctionPointer() to retrieve the function pointer\n2. Dereferences the returned pointer to get the actual function address\n3. Stores the function address to global cache variable DAT_0435b384\n\nReturns:\nvoid - function stores result to global variable, no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- The returned pointer must be dereferenced before use\n- Result is cached in global memory for subsequent accesses\n- Function uses __stdcall calling convention",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
