      "name": "CacheGameFunctionPointer",
      "signature": "void CacheGameFunctionPointer(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Cache and store a Diablo II game function pointer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_04277e20 to retrieve the game function pointer reference\n2. Dereference the returned pointer to obtain the actual function address\n3. Store the dereferenced function address into DAT_0435b388 cache location\n4. Return from function\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, stores result in global cache variable\n\nPurpose:\nThis function acts as a wrapper that retrieves and caches a Diablo II game\nfunction pointer into a global variable (DAT_0435b388). It initializes and\nmaintains the cached reference for later retrieval by other game systems.",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:8414efd6c6e404130e1c0a48010e9ecb",
