      "name": "GetD2FunctionAddress",
      "signature": "undefined4 GetD2FunctionAddress(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves and caches a D2 game function pointer address.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetD2FunctionPointer() to obtain the cached function pointer\n2. Dereference the pointer to get the actual function address\n3. Store the function address at global location 0x0435b3cc\n4. Return void (__stdcall)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - This is a wrapper that stores the function address in a global variable\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- The function uses __stdcall calling convention with callee cleanup\n- Returns nothing (void), but stores result in global DAT_0435b3cc\n- The actual initialization is delegated to FUN_04274520",
