      "name": "FetchAndCacheStateValue",
      "signature": "void FetchAndCacheStateValue(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Fetches state value from provider function and caches it in global storage\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls the state provider function to obtain a pointer to state data\n2. Dereferences the returned pointer to extract the state value\n3. Stores the extracted value in the global cache location\n\nReturns:\nNone (void function)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Assumes the provider function at 0x042748e0 always returns a valid pointer\n- Assumes the pointed-to memory contains a DWORD value\n- Global cache location DAT_0435b3b0 is overwritten unconditionally",
