      "name": "InitializeGameFunctionPointer",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameFunctionPointer(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the cached game function pointer.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Call FUN_04276770 to get reference to function pointer storage (DAT_0435bb9c)\\n2. Dereference the returned pointer to extract the actual function pointer value\\n3. Store the function pointer in DAT_0435b3dc for later invocation by FUN_042ac450\\n\\nReturns:\\nvoid - No return value; stores result in global variable DAT_0435b3dc\\n\\nPurpose:\\nThis function sets up a cached function pointer that is later called by FUN_042ac450. The indirection through FUN_04276770 ensures thread-safe initialization of game function pointers based on game version detection.\\n\\nRelated Functions:\\n- FUN_04276770: Returns reference to game function pointer (performs version detection)\\n- FUN_042ac450: Calls the cached function pointer stored by this function",
