      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes all game data structures and containers during static initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up structured exception handling (SEH) frame\n2. Allocate a 20-byte linked list node for initialization tracking\n3. Initialize node with self-referential pointers and 0x101 flag\n4. Load global data from addresses 0x0433ffe0 through 0x043401d0\n5. Call FUN_0427c870 36 times to initialize container/vector structures\n6. Call FUN_0427c910 to finalize global data at 0x0435b3ec\n7. Invoke destructor cleanup for temporary buffers\n8. Register atexit handler for program cleanup\n9. Restore and return\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Pure initialization function",
